why: the note opens on an actor the site does not name and uses a name the reader cannot place; Kirill on 2026-09-21: "This looks out of blue and hard to follow"; the expected form names the site's subject first and places the outside name with an appositive, and no check reaches this, so judgement decides it
labelled: 2026-09-21
--- code
export function withOnlySettlement(source: SourceConfig, scheme: Settlement): SourceConfig {
  return { ...source, settlements: [scheme] };
}
--- facts
The ledger can choose a settlement that preferredSettlements does not name, so withOnlySettlement removes the others.
